# Copy to secrets/telegram.env on the NAS (mode 600, owned by the coach user). NEVER commit the real file.
# Test phase: use a SEPARATE test bot (BotFather /newbot) and the test state files below, so the
# production bot (still polled by the Cowork task) is untouched. Only one poller per bot token!
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_ALLOWED_CHAT_ID=
# Test-phase state (separate from the production offset/log):
TELEGRAM_OFFSET_FILE=/workspace/athletes/tommi/telegram-test-offset.txt
TELEGRAM_CONVLOG_FILE=/workspace/athletes/tommi/telegram-test-conversation-log.md
# At cutover: switch to the production bot token and delete the two TELEGRAM_*_FILE lines
# (the defaults are <athlete>/telegram-last-update.txt and <athlete>/telegram-conversation-log.md).
